WEBVTT

00:00:06.006 --> 00:00:09.926
A NETFLIX SERIES

00:00:19.769 --> 00:00:22.647
KOTARO LIVES ALONE

00:01:11.988 --> 00:01:14.532
Then, let me introduce him again.

00:01:14.616 --> 00:01:17.035
This is my neighbor, Sir Karino.

00:01:17.535 --> 00:01:19.913
Nice to meet you.

00:01:19.996 --> 00:01:21.790
Nice to meet you!

00:01:22.373 --> 00:01:24.501
Why am I in this situation?

00:01:25.418 --> 00:01:26.544
A movie?

00:01:26.628 --> 00:01:31.758
Right. I was told to see any movie
at a movie theater to inspire my manga.

00:01:32.592 --> 00:01:34.469
A movie theater, you say?

00:01:34.552 --> 00:01:35.845
It cannot be helped.

00:01:35.929 --> 00:01:38.765
I shall accompany you as your guardian.

00:01:38.848 --> 00:01:41.643
Just be straight and say you want to go.

00:01:42.519 --> 00:01:45.396
Lucky! I wanna go to to the movie theater!

00:01:45.480 --> 00:01:47.023
And so,

00:01:47.107 --> 00:01:49.484
could you take our kids
to the movie theater?

00:01:52.779 --> 00:01:55.782
When you said movie theater,
you meant Aeyon!

00:01:55.865 --> 00:01:57.742
No, the top floor is the--

00:01:57.826 --> 00:02:00.286
My mom said Aeyon is expensive!

00:02:00.370 --> 00:02:01.955
I wanna go to the toy store!

00:02:02.038 --> 00:02:04.666
Karino, let's hurry and go the movie!

00:02:04.749 --> 00:02:06.918
I got it. Don't pull me!

00:02:08.211 --> 00:02:10.421
Don't mess around on the escalator!

00:02:10.505 --> 00:02:11.881
Hey, I said stop!

00:02:14.676 --> 00:02:16.761
It's no good. I'm already tired.

00:02:17.846 --> 00:02:21.599
TONOSAMAN THE MOVIE

00:02:21.683 --> 00:02:23.935
Karino, I want to watch this!

00:02:24.018 --> 00:02:24.853
Huh?

00:02:24.936 --> 00:02:27.313
Dinosaur Hunter 3D?

00:02:27.397 --> 00:02:29.774
I wanna see it too! They jump out at you!

00:02:29.858 --> 00:02:31.818
Does poop come flying out too?

00:02:32.402 --> 00:02:34.779
Are you fine not watching that one?

00:02:36.239 --> 00:02:37.574
I am fine either way.

00:02:38.449 --> 00:02:41.327
Karino, I wanna eat popcorn!

00:02:41.411 --> 00:02:43.037
So expensive.

00:02:43.121 --> 00:02:47.333
But wait, is it better to look good
for Kotaro's friends?

00:02:47.417 --> 00:02:48.376
If I refuse,

00:02:48.459 --> 00:02:51.296
will you lose face because people will say

00:02:51.379 --> 00:02:54.007
that your guardian's cheap, or something?

00:02:54.924 --> 00:02:57.302
It can't be helped. Just do it!

00:02:57.385 --> 00:02:58.720
I'll buy everything!

00:02:58.803 --> 00:03:00.054
Hooray!

00:03:00.138 --> 00:03:01.764
Hey, which one do you want?

00:03:02.599 --> 00:03:03.433
Huh?

00:03:03.933 --> 00:03:06.394
Well then, three kids sets!

00:03:07.061 --> 00:03:08.938
Oh, wow!

00:03:09.022 --> 00:03:12.150
Shh! Don't spill!

00:03:12.734 --> 00:03:15.486
I said be quiet! Shh!

00:03:19.157 --> 00:03:21.034
That was fun!

00:03:21.117 --> 00:03:23.411
Karino, let's go to the toy store!

00:03:23.494 --> 00:03:25.038
Let's go!

00:03:25.121 --> 00:03:26.664
Apologies, my friends,

00:03:27.290 --> 00:03:29.459
but Sir Karino is a poor manga artist,

00:03:29.542 --> 00:03:31.502
so he is not very wealthy.

00:03:31.586 --> 00:03:33.671
Well, if it's just a little bit--

00:03:33.755 --> 00:03:34.672
Sir Karino!

00:03:34.756 --> 00:03:37.717
You came here for work today, did you not?

00:03:37.800 --> 00:03:39.219
Well, let us go home.

00:03:39.302 --> 00:03:40.386
Oh, hey!

00:03:42.347 --> 00:03:44.724
Karino, thank you!

00:03:44.807 --> 00:03:47.435
Hey, you mean Mr. Karino, right?

00:03:47.518 --> 00:03:48.686
That was fun.

00:03:50.230 --> 00:03:51.189
I'm no good.

00:03:51.272 --> 00:03:54.275
I'm never supervising them again.

00:03:59.239 --> 00:04:01.866
What's wrong? Why are you so close?

00:04:02.951 --> 00:04:05.245
Don't be silent. Say something.

00:04:06.746 --> 00:04:10.208
Wait, what? Are you upset with me
or something?

00:04:11.125 --> 00:04:14.420
You were having a lot of fun
with my friends.

00:04:15.546 --> 00:04:18.341
Are you not my guardian?

00:04:21.552 --> 00:04:24.639
Sorry for looking after your friends
instead of you.

00:04:24.722 --> 00:04:27.100
Hey, what kind of statement is that?

00:04:27.183 --> 00:04:28.559
Why are you laughing?

00:04:28.643 --> 00:04:30.436
Are you making fun of me?

00:04:31.020 --> 00:04:32.647
I'm not making fun of you.

00:04:35.400 --> 00:04:37.652
I'm going to watch another movie for work.

00:04:37.735 --> 00:04:39.153
Do you want to come with me?

00:04:39.862 --> 00:04:41.614
This time it's Tonosaman.

00:04:46.160 --> 00:04:49.038
It cannot be helped. I will go.

00:04:50.623 --> 00:04:53.501
Apologies to keep you waiting.
I am Tonosaman!

00:04:53.584 --> 00:04:56.379
Apologies to keep you waiting.
I am Tonosaman!

00:04:56.462 --> 00:04:59.757
This anime is really boring…

00:05:03.052 --> 00:05:05.054
Ow!

00:05:05.138 --> 00:05:07.181
I can hold back with cheek rubs,

00:05:07.265 --> 00:05:10.351
but just let me play with you, Kotaro!

00:05:10.435 --> 00:05:13.229
Have you still not been able
to see your son?

00:05:15.982 --> 00:05:17.400
Well,

00:05:17.483 --> 00:05:21.154
my ex-wife told me,
"he doesn't want to see his papa."

00:05:21.738 --> 00:05:25.116
But, well, it can't be helped. Look at me.

00:05:26.117 --> 00:05:29.078
You may come in. Are you okay with milk?

00:05:30.830 --> 00:05:33.750
Kotaro! Ow!

00:05:33.833 --> 00:05:36.252
A FEW DAYS LATER

00:05:38.212 --> 00:05:39.172
Who are you?

00:05:40.214 --> 00:05:41.090
Huh?

00:05:42.091 --> 00:05:45.845
Hey, what do we have here?
You got a problem?

00:05:45.928 --> 00:05:49.223
You should introduce yourself
before asking that.

00:05:49.307 --> 00:05:51.434
I am Kotaro Sato.

00:05:51.517 --> 00:05:53.644
I am a resident
of this apartment building.

00:05:53.728 --> 00:05:56.939
What? So you know about my dad?

00:05:57.023 --> 00:05:58.149
Hmm?

00:05:58.733 --> 00:06:01.152
My dad lives here!

00:06:02.945 --> 00:06:04.947
Huh, what? Son?

00:06:05.031 --> 00:06:06.407
My son? What?

00:06:07.158 --> 00:06:08.117
Not him.

00:06:08.201 --> 00:06:11.746
My dad doesn't seem as unreliable
as this guy does.

00:06:11.829 --> 00:06:13.498
I see. Sorry about that.

00:06:14.957 --> 00:06:17.126
I had no idea you were Sir Tamaru's son.

00:06:17.627 --> 00:06:20.505
Sir Tamaru is out right now.

00:06:20.588 --> 00:06:23.007
Therefore, let us wait
in my room for a while.

00:06:23.091 --> 00:06:25.635
All right, thanks man.

00:06:25.718 --> 00:06:28.554
However, I heard from Sir Tamaru that

00:06:28.638 --> 00:06:31.599
you didn't want to see your father?

00:06:31.682 --> 00:06:33.434
You're wrong! Mom said that--

00:06:33.518 --> 00:06:36.729
Kotaro! Thanks for wait--

00:06:36.813 --> 00:06:37.939
Dad!

00:06:38.022 --> 00:06:40.775
Yuta? Why are you here?

00:06:41.359 --> 00:06:45.154
Hey, it's been a while, Dad!
I came to see you!

00:06:45.238 --> 00:06:47.281
But Yuta, you…

00:06:48.241 --> 00:06:49.700
I didn't know

00:06:50.284 --> 00:06:53.371
about the plans for you, Mom
and me to meet.

00:06:53.454 --> 00:06:56.457
Mom never told me.

00:06:56.541 --> 00:07:00.837
So, I secretly looked up your address
and came to meet you.

00:07:00.920 --> 00:07:02.839
I came here without telling Mom.

00:07:03.506 --> 00:07:06.134
I wanted to see you, Dad, so I came!

00:07:08.177 --> 00:07:09.929
Is this not great?

00:07:10.012 --> 00:07:11.556
You finally got to see him.

00:07:11.639 --> 00:07:13.266
Go home right away.

00:07:13.766 --> 00:07:14.642
Huh?

00:07:15.435 --> 00:07:16.894
Why?

00:07:17.728 --> 00:07:20.523
What are you saying, Sir Tamaru?
You should…

00:07:23.359 --> 00:07:26.529
Daddy's not happy about us
meeting like this today.

00:07:27.071 --> 00:07:29.115
If you come on another unplanned day,

00:07:29.198 --> 00:07:31.284
I won't meet or talk to you.

00:07:31.826 --> 00:07:34.454
You have to follow the rules.

00:07:34.537 --> 00:07:36.831
But Mom kept those plans from me--

00:07:36.914 --> 00:07:40.042
I'm not talking about Mom,
I'm talking about you right now.

00:07:42.170 --> 00:07:43.004
Okay.

00:07:43.087 --> 00:07:46.132
I'll call Mom
and have her pick you up right away.

00:07:50.011 --> 00:07:52.472
I spoke with your mom
and cleared things up.

00:07:52.555 --> 00:07:56.058
Next time, all three of us
will meet at the end of the month.

00:07:56.893 --> 00:07:57.977
Okay.

00:08:00.563 --> 00:08:01.564
Later.

00:08:03.774 --> 00:08:04.609
Okay.

00:08:10.031 --> 00:08:12.909
I'm sorry I can't be with you
all the time.

00:08:16.913 --> 00:08:18.289
Yeah.

00:08:24.754 --> 00:08:26.923
Ow!

00:08:27.006 --> 00:08:29.675
Sir Yuta came
all the way over here for you!

00:08:29.759 --> 00:08:32.178
Why did you send him home quickly,
Sir Tamaru?

00:08:32.261 --> 00:08:35.139
Is it just me, or are you stabbing me
harder than usual?

00:08:35.223 --> 00:08:39.143
You wanted to see Sir Yuta so badly!

00:08:39.644 --> 00:08:42.104
Yeah, I wanted to see him…

00:08:42.813 --> 00:08:47.026
But, I don't want Yuta to become an adult

00:08:47.109 --> 00:08:51.197
who breaks rules just because he can.

00:08:51.781 --> 00:08:55.618
Although I do feel very bad
about making him lonely.

00:08:58.454 --> 00:09:01.999
I see. So that is your way
of showing love, Sir Tamaru.

00:09:03.125 --> 00:09:07.129
Maybe your dad
also felt the same as well, Kotaro.

00:09:07.213 --> 00:09:09.340
Huh? What do you mean?

00:09:09.423 --> 00:09:13.553
Of course, it was absolutely wrong
for your father to hurt you.

00:09:13.636 --> 00:09:18.224
But I'd like to believe
that he loved you too…

00:09:19.934 --> 00:09:20.810
After all,

00:09:22.061 --> 00:09:26.023
There's no way you wouldn't
adore your own kid.

00:09:29.068 --> 00:09:35.157
I see. You did well holding back
your tears in front of Sir Yuta.

00:09:35.866 --> 00:09:37.743
I commend you.

00:09:37.827 --> 00:09:40.079
Kotaro!

00:09:44.667 --> 00:09:46.210
Yes? Oh.

00:09:46.294 --> 00:09:48.671
I just moved into Room 201 today.

00:09:48.754 --> 00:09:51.674
My name is Sumire Takei. Nice to meet you.

00:09:52.341 --> 00:09:54.719
Nice to meet you. I'm Shin Karino.

00:09:55.720 --> 00:09:58.806
This icy beauty, Sumire Takei,

00:09:59.432 --> 00:10:02.101
gives off the strong vibes
of a career woman.

00:10:02.810 --> 00:10:04.687
But more than that…

00:10:04.770 --> 00:10:07.565
At least divide the trash properly!

00:10:07.648 --> 00:10:09.525
It's why adults these days are useless.

00:10:09.609 --> 00:10:11.777
Enough! Why don't you shut up?

00:10:12.486 --> 00:10:14.780
She feels like a nagging mom.

00:10:15.281 --> 00:10:16.490
Good morning to you!

00:10:16.574 --> 00:10:19.285
Oh, Kotaro. Good morning!

00:10:19.368 --> 00:10:21.621
You can say hello,
but keep your hands moving.

00:10:23.039 --> 00:10:24.874
Good morning, Kotaro.

00:10:25.416 --> 00:10:27.168
Good morning to you, Lady Takei.

00:10:27.251 --> 00:10:30.588
You're such a good boy, Kotaro.
You separate your garbage properly.

00:10:30.671 --> 00:10:33.549
You're an example of
how everyone should be!

00:10:33.633 --> 00:10:37.261
Oh, that girl is helping walk her pet.

00:10:37.345 --> 00:10:39.764
That boy's doing morning training
for his school club.

00:10:39.847 --> 00:10:41.932
He's working so hard! What a champ.

00:10:42.016 --> 00:10:44.852
However, she loves to praise these kids,

00:10:46.020 --> 00:10:49.607
while she sweats buckets.

00:10:50.775 --> 00:10:53.235
It just looks like she's trying too hard.

00:10:53.736 --> 00:10:56.155
Her greeting when she moved in.

00:10:56.238 --> 00:10:58.949
Kids live in this apartment building?

00:10:59.033 --> 00:11:01.035
One kid lives by himself.

00:11:01.118 --> 00:11:04.372
Mr. Tamaru and I take
and pick him up from kindergarten.

00:11:04.955 --> 00:11:05.790
What's wrong?

00:11:05.873 --> 00:11:09.585
Oh, nothing! I'll help
since we live in the same building.

00:11:09.669 --> 00:11:11.337
Obviously, right?

00:11:11.837 --> 00:11:15.841
She's most likely
uncomfortable around kids,

00:11:16.550 --> 00:11:20.096
but for some reason, Kotaro is chasing
the struggling Ms. Takei.

00:11:22.014 --> 00:11:24.392
Is this tag? I won't lose!

00:11:24.934 --> 00:11:27.103
He even seems to be enjoying it.

00:11:27.186 --> 00:11:30.439
I thought he was the type
to be sensitive to situations like this.

00:11:31.732 --> 00:11:35.069
Sorry for the sudden request.
I can't pick him up from kindergarten

00:11:35.152 --> 00:11:36.278
because of work.

00:11:36.821 --> 00:11:38.406
Mr. Tamaru isn't here either.

00:11:39.115 --> 00:11:40.950
I know it's sudden, Ms. Takei,

00:11:41.033 --> 00:11:43.369
but could I ask you to go pick him up?

00:11:45.413 --> 00:11:47.623
Well, is that okay?

00:11:47.707 --> 00:11:49.458
Of course it's okay!

00:11:49.542 --> 00:11:52.503
I have plenty of time.
I'm actually happy to help!

00:11:55.047 --> 00:11:57.216
Ms. Takei came to pick you up in a taxi?

00:11:57.299 --> 00:11:59.760
Yes. It was only for a short time,

00:11:59.844 --> 00:12:02.513
but we got to talk with the driver.

00:12:03.013 --> 00:12:05.391
Lady Takei was forcing herself

00:12:05.474 --> 00:12:07.309
a little too much today though.

00:12:09.061 --> 00:12:11.188
Sorry about the sudden request today.

00:12:11.731 --> 00:12:14.817
What are you talking about?
I said I'd help out!

00:12:14.900 --> 00:12:18.988
It's no problem at all.
It's absolutely fine when I have time!

00:12:19.071 --> 00:12:20.281
But, Ms. Takei,

00:12:21.157 --> 00:12:22.742
you don't really like kids, right?

00:12:22.825 --> 00:12:24.326
How did you find--

00:12:25.161 --> 00:12:26.829
It's not that I don't like them.

00:12:26.912 --> 00:12:28.748
You don't have to hide it…

00:12:30.541 --> 00:12:32.668
He's probably noticed as well.

00:12:32.752 --> 00:12:34.295
He's a sensitive kid.

00:12:35.212 --> 00:12:37.715
So, it's okay. Don't force yourself.

00:12:38.424 --> 00:12:40.885
You can't help it if you don't like kids.

00:12:40.968 --> 00:12:42.344
I think that's fine.

00:12:44.013 --> 00:12:46.807
If only it were that simple.

00:12:46.891 --> 00:12:47.725
Huh?

00:12:48.350 --> 00:12:51.854
Do you know how hard it is
for a woman who doesn't like kids?

00:12:53.063 --> 00:12:57.067
Women get looked at strangely
just for being uncomfortable with kids.

00:12:57.860 --> 00:13:01.238
I didn't choose to be
uncomfortable with kids!

00:13:01.822 --> 00:13:05.576
I want to do something about it,
so don't say that…

00:13:07.620 --> 00:13:08.704
so lightly!

00:13:11.123 --> 00:13:13.626
It feels like she must be struggling
with a lot.

00:13:15.211 --> 00:13:16.045
But…

00:13:19.006 --> 00:13:21.550
This is tag, huh? This is tag, right?

00:13:22.927 --> 00:13:24.595
That kid…

00:13:24.678 --> 00:13:27.848
Doesn't he sense that Ms. Takei
isn't great with kids?

00:13:27.932 --> 00:13:32.061
There was a period when my parents
were uncomfortable with me as well,

00:13:32.144 --> 00:13:35.272
but they tried hard
to conquer their discomfort.

00:13:35.356 --> 00:13:38.108
So I will help you out!

00:13:38.818 --> 00:13:42.905
Lady Takei, I think that
you want to get along with me!

00:13:48.410 --> 00:13:50.704
I thought so.

00:13:50.788 --> 00:13:52.540
He's always steps ahead of me.

00:13:53.624 --> 00:13:56.544
Although it looks like
he's messing with her too…

00:14:03.926 --> 00:14:06.303
Something's off!

00:14:06.887 --> 00:14:08.722
Good morning, Ms. Takei.

00:14:09.431 --> 00:14:12.768
Mr. Karino.
I haven't seen Kotaro in a while,

00:14:12.852 --> 00:14:14.395
but he seems different.

00:14:14.478 --> 00:14:17.106
So you think so too, Ms. Takei?

00:14:17.690 --> 00:14:19.859
Hey, you've gained weight recently.

00:14:19.942 --> 00:14:20.901
He's so direct!

00:14:20.985 --> 00:14:24.446
It is true that my weight
has been increasing every day.

00:14:24.530 --> 00:14:28.367
However, eating is
an important daily event.

00:14:29.159 --> 00:14:30.244
Let me be clear!

00:14:30.327 --> 00:14:32.997
I am not eating tissues anymore.

00:14:33.080 --> 00:14:34.456
I know that!

00:14:34.540 --> 00:14:35.624
Tissues?

00:14:37.710 --> 00:14:38.961
All right, Lady Takei!

00:14:39.044 --> 00:14:41.922
This is special training
to conquer your fear of kids!

00:14:44.300 --> 00:14:46.385
Are you okay?

00:14:46.468 --> 00:14:48.095
I'm totally fine!

00:14:48.178 --> 00:14:51.015
More importantly, what was that
about him eating tissues?

00:14:51.098 --> 00:14:53.726
Oh, actually,

00:14:53.809 --> 00:14:56.979
he was neglected by his parents
in the past.

00:14:57.062 --> 00:14:59.440
He couldn't stand the hunger,
so he ate tissues.

00:15:00.441 --> 00:15:02.568
I see. I didn't know he went through that.

00:15:03.152 --> 00:15:06.447
Could the trauma from that
be causing him to binge eat?

00:15:06.530 --> 00:15:08.574
He's never done it before, though.

00:15:09.158 --> 00:15:11.160
There must be some cause for this.

00:15:11.952 --> 00:15:13.621
What's that there?

00:15:14.204 --> 00:15:16.582
Oh, there's a meeting
for kindergarten guardians

00:15:16.665 --> 00:15:18.876
to check the daily school lunches.

00:15:20.753 --> 00:15:24.506
I'll go to that.
I've studied nutrition before.

00:15:24.590 --> 00:15:25.799
What? But you…

00:15:25.883 --> 00:15:27.176
I said I'm going!

00:15:30.679 --> 00:15:33.265
I didn't think I'd be with kindergartners.

00:15:33.349 --> 00:15:35.142
I shouldn't have come!

00:15:35.809 --> 00:15:36.977
Ms. Tohko!

00:15:37.061 --> 00:15:40.022
Have you followed the policy
since last time?

00:15:40.105 --> 00:15:42.066
Yes, it's okay.

00:15:42.149 --> 00:15:43.442
That's good.

00:15:43.525 --> 00:15:46.820
It would be outdated
to force kids to eat more than they need.

00:15:46.904 --> 00:15:50.032
And it can cause stress and trauma.

00:15:50.115 --> 00:15:51.784
Seriously…

00:15:52.576 --> 00:15:54.453
Thank you for the food!

00:15:56.997 --> 00:16:00.125
Lady Takei, you have not been eating.

00:16:00.209 --> 00:16:01.961
Yes, but I'm okay.

00:16:03.921 --> 00:16:06.465
The menu seems well thought out
and well balanced.

00:16:06.548 --> 00:16:09.551
It doesn't seem to be the cause
of his weight gain.

00:16:09.635 --> 00:16:11.053
Hey, Kotaro!

00:16:11.136 --> 00:16:13.597
You'll eat my leftovers today too, right?

00:16:14.306 --> 00:16:15.516
I have no problem.

00:16:15.599 --> 00:16:16.725
Mine too!

00:16:16.809 --> 00:16:19.186
I know you can do it, Kotaro!

00:16:19.269 --> 00:16:22.523
Isn't it rude to give leftovers to Kotaro?

00:16:22.606 --> 00:16:26.151
It's fine!
Kotaro will eat anything for us!

00:16:26.235 --> 00:16:27.945
Let's play outside!

00:16:28.028 --> 00:16:29.113
Let's go!

00:16:36.620 --> 00:16:40.249
You're such a good boy, Kotaro.
You're not a picky eater.

00:16:40.332 --> 00:16:42.960
Seriously, you'll grow big!

00:16:44.795 --> 00:16:47.506
Kotaro, is that delicious?

00:16:48.173 --> 00:16:49.425
I do not know.

00:16:50.009 --> 00:16:52.594
However, I just cannot stop

00:16:53.220 --> 00:16:55.097
when food is in front of me.

00:17:00.769 --> 00:17:03.939
Of course. You understand
how precious food is

00:17:04.982 --> 00:17:07.609
more than anyone, Kotaro.

00:17:11.196 --> 00:17:12.740
Kotaro!

00:17:12.823 --> 00:17:14.074
Thank you for waiting.

00:17:16.201 --> 00:17:20.330
It's been decided that the guardians
and I will instruct the children

00:17:20.831 --> 00:17:23.959
Kotaro shouldn't be given leftovers again.

00:17:24.835 --> 00:17:27.421
We'll be sure to follow through with that.

00:17:27.504 --> 00:17:31.050
The point of having
the parents attend the meeting,

00:17:31.133 --> 00:17:34.386
was so they can observe
their children's behavior during mealtime.

00:17:34.470 --> 00:17:37.139
Yes. That's why we have it
several times a year.

00:17:38.140 --> 00:17:40.267
So please come again.

00:17:40.350 --> 00:17:41.268
What? Oh…

00:17:46.315 --> 00:17:49.276
Right. I will come again.

00:17:49.359 --> 00:17:50.694
Is that okay?

00:17:51.487 --> 00:17:52.780
Huh?

00:17:52.863 --> 00:17:56.408
Since my latest obsession
is chasing Lady Takei,

00:17:56.492 --> 00:17:58.869
follow me, everyone!

00:17:58.952 --> 00:18:00.037
What?!

00:18:01.997 --> 00:18:04.500
Maybe I can't handle this after all!

00:18:06.043 --> 00:18:09.713
COLLECTION/GOOD DAY FOR SOCCER

00:18:10.714 --> 00:18:14.760
You should look at this, Sir Karino.
It is a strangely shaped rock.

00:18:14.843 --> 00:18:16.095
It's just a rock.

00:18:16.178 --> 00:18:20.474
I will add this rock
to my collection box today.

00:18:20.557 --> 00:18:22.059
Collection box?

00:18:22.142 --> 00:18:25.312
It's a box with all kinds of collectibles.

00:18:25.896 --> 00:18:28.524
Sometimes, I lay the contents on a table,

00:18:28.607 --> 00:18:31.902
and admire them while I sip some milk.

00:18:31.985 --> 00:18:36.031
I'm begging you.
Act a little more like a kid!

00:18:36.115 --> 00:18:37.491
- Oh, right!
- Huh?

00:18:39.118 --> 00:18:42.162
"My Collection Exhibition Entry Ticket."

00:18:42.788 --> 00:18:45.999
This was in my mailbox
so I decided to stop by, but…

00:18:46.083 --> 00:18:48.836
I was invited by Kotaro!

00:18:48.919 --> 00:18:51.964
This is exciting, huh?

00:18:52.548 --> 00:18:55.217
Thank you for coming to
my collection exhibition.

00:18:55.300 --> 00:18:57.427
Well then, please come in.

00:18:58.011 --> 00:19:00.806
Wow, this is amazing, Kotaro!

00:19:00.889 --> 00:19:03.100
It looks like a real museum.

00:19:03.183 --> 00:19:04.935
Can we touch the items?

00:19:05.018 --> 00:19:07.563
Yes. Please enjoy them
as much as you like.

00:19:08.313 --> 00:19:10.399
There's the picture I drew and gave him.

00:19:11.108 --> 00:19:12.860
Even the drawings on the band-aids…

00:19:14.486 --> 00:19:16.155
I'll do my best at work.

00:19:17.072 --> 00:19:19.199
This is the paper bag from the store

00:19:19.283 --> 00:19:21.952
where Kotaro and I went clothes shopping!

00:19:22.035 --> 00:19:23.245
I see.

00:19:23.328 --> 00:19:26.206
It includes Kotaro's memorabilia too.

00:19:26.290 --> 00:19:27.666
I wanna go again!

00:19:28.250 --> 00:19:29.960
Kotaro, what are these?

00:19:30.043 --> 00:19:33.088
Yes. They are something
my mother left behind.

00:19:33.755 --> 00:19:37.050
The gloves my mother used
when holding me.

00:19:38.927 --> 00:19:40.512
What does that mean?

00:19:41.513 --> 00:19:44.308
Kotaro, should we throw them away?

00:19:44.391 --> 00:19:45.225
Hmm?

00:19:45.851 --> 00:19:46.685
Ms. Takei?

00:19:48.103 --> 00:19:49.146
I do not want to.

00:19:49.229 --> 00:19:52.065
No, it's better to throw them away.

00:19:52.149 --> 00:19:54.902
- Hey, what are you saying?
- What happened all of a sudden?

00:19:54.985 --> 00:19:58.280
If you can't throw them away yourself,
I'll throw them away.

00:19:58.363 --> 00:20:00.032
Here, give them to me.

00:20:00.115 --> 00:20:01.325
No, they are--

00:20:01.408 --> 00:20:02.868
I'm saying throw them away!

00:20:04.077 --> 00:20:05.370
Lay off of him!

00:20:05.454 --> 00:20:06.788
Calm down, Mr. Tamaru!

00:20:06.872 --> 00:20:09.166
Just throw them away! Throw them away!

00:20:13.462 --> 00:20:16.173
Why were you wearing gloves
when changing her clothes?

00:20:16.256 --> 00:20:19.218
I don't like touching that kid.

00:20:19.801 --> 00:20:23.263
I've been feeling
an aversion to her lately.

00:20:23.931 --> 00:20:25.849
It makes me sick to touch her.

00:20:28.727 --> 00:20:30.604
I am sorry, Lady Takei.

00:20:31.855 --> 00:20:36.485
My mother went so far as to put
these gloves on to clothe me,

00:20:36.568 --> 00:20:38.237
wash my hair…

00:20:38.820 --> 00:20:40.822
and touch me.

00:20:43.575 --> 00:20:46.620
You knew how your mom felt?

00:20:47.663 --> 00:20:50.791
Therefore, I do not want to
throw these away.

00:20:55.712 --> 00:20:58.966
Having your mother touch you
with gloves on…

00:20:59.800 --> 00:21:01.969
is something I'm painfully familiar with.

00:21:02.678 --> 00:21:07.057
That's why I thought
we should throw away those gloves.

00:21:08.225 --> 00:21:11.770
Maybe even a painful thing like that

00:21:12.437 --> 00:21:13.981
is important because

00:21:14.064 --> 00:21:17.150
it's a memory of his mom
that he doesn't want to forget.

00:21:18.944 --> 00:21:20.445
How could that be?

00:21:22.072 --> 00:21:23.198
It's too sad.

00:21:24.950 --> 00:21:29.079
As long as I have these,
no matter when mother comes home,

00:21:30.038 --> 00:21:31.206
it will be okay.

00:21:38.338 --> 00:21:40.257
Are you ready, Sir Hide?

00:21:40.340 --> 00:21:42.426
I shall pass you the ball now.

00:21:42.509 --> 00:21:44.136
Hurry up already!

00:21:44.219 --> 00:21:45.220
Well then…

00:21:51.768 --> 00:21:52.686
That was a feint.

00:21:52.769 --> 00:21:55.564
Why would you feint your teammate,
you dummy!

00:21:57.649 --> 00:21:59.693
A kids' soccer club?

00:21:59.776 --> 00:22:03.071
I joined a soccer club the other day

00:22:03.155 --> 00:22:06.950
to enjoy soccer with kids
from kindergarten to elementary school.

00:22:07.034 --> 00:22:10.662
I mean, do you even
know how to play soccer?

00:22:10.746 --> 00:22:12.706
I am good at feints.

00:22:17.377 --> 00:22:19.171
You do it like this. Easy, right?

00:22:19.671 --> 00:22:21.048
Yes! Well then.

00:22:22.883 --> 00:22:24.176
Darn you!

00:22:24.259 --> 00:22:25.886
It was not on purpose.

00:22:25.969 --> 00:22:27.012
Of course!

00:22:27.095 --> 00:22:27.971
Hey, c'mon!

00:22:29.431 --> 00:22:31.058
Hurry up and get ready to leave!

00:22:31.141 --> 00:22:33.894
Sorry, Sir Coach! We will leave now!

00:22:34.478 --> 00:22:37.356
Sir Hide, thank you
for instructing me again today.

00:22:38.190 --> 00:22:39.858
Is something wrong?

00:22:40.442 --> 00:22:42.402
No, it's nothing…

00:22:43.528 --> 00:22:45.447
Kotaro, go head on home.

00:22:46.406 --> 00:22:47.240
Yes.

00:22:48.033 --> 00:22:49.368
A FEW DAYS LATER

00:22:49.451 --> 00:22:51.161
Thank you for today!

00:22:51.953 --> 00:22:53.705
Ugh, I'm nervous.

00:22:54.247 --> 00:22:56.583
Aren't you nervous, Hide?

00:22:56.666 --> 00:23:00.087
This is a piece of cake.
Just play as you usually do.

00:23:00.170 --> 00:23:03.006
That is right. Just play as we usually do.

00:23:03.090 --> 00:23:05.217
Kotaro, you need to play
better than usual!

00:23:08.345 --> 00:23:09.596
Nice shot!

00:23:10.555 --> 00:23:13.100
My moves helped you out, did they not?

00:23:13.183 --> 00:23:16.686
You just ran away from the ball!

00:23:16.770 --> 00:23:18.688
You said to run around.

00:23:18.772 --> 00:23:20.690
I didn't mean for you to randomly--

00:23:20.774 --> 00:23:21.900
Defense!

00:23:21.983 --> 00:23:25.487
You need to come back faster!
The other side won't wait for you!

00:23:25.570 --> 00:23:28.573
Wow. Their coach seems strict.

00:23:28.657 --> 00:23:30.700
And, Sir Hide, I…

00:23:32.327 --> 00:23:33.537
Sir Hide?

00:23:38.625 --> 00:23:42.838
Hey, I said hurry back!
How many times have I said that?!

00:23:46.508 --> 00:23:49.511
Hide! Why can't you listen to what I say?!

00:23:49.594 --> 00:23:52.597
Hey! Why can't you
do something this easy?!

00:23:53.348 --> 00:23:56.601
What's going on?
You're with Hide more than me!

00:23:56.685 --> 00:23:58.311
It's always me!

00:23:58.395 --> 00:24:01.606
Do you think I can take care of him
all the time?!

00:24:07.028 --> 00:24:08.780
In times like these,

00:24:08.864 --> 00:24:10.657
a friend of mine did this for me,

00:24:10.740 --> 00:24:12.659
which helped calm me down.

00:24:13.326 --> 00:24:17.706
You will be okay.
He is not getting mad at you.

00:24:21.126 --> 00:24:24.045
I know that.
We're in the middle of a game!

00:24:24.129 --> 00:24:24.963
Huh?

00:24:27.466 --> 00:24:30.051
What is it? Why are you following me?

00:24:30.135 --> 00:24:31.678
What is wrong? No need to be shy.

00:24:31.761 --> 00:24:32.596
Who's shy?!

00:24:32.679 --> 00:24:33.555
Hide!

00:24:44.357 --> 00:24:45.775
That was a nice shot, yes?

00:24:46.485 --> 00:24:47.777
Well, yes.

00:24:48.403 --> 00:24:49.613
Nice shot.
